{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05269","headline":"哭仆射鄂公杨再思 · 赵彦昭","name":"哭仆射鄂公杨再思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"两揆光天秩，三朝奉帝熙。\n何言集大鸟，忽此丧元龟。\n坐叹公槐落，行闻宰树悲。\n壑舟今已去，宁有济川期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵彦昭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}